'''Mizli''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES (Gacha Event)|Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]] increases health and attack power. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 14.7 Update|Version 14.7]] increases health and attack power, adds extra range, replaces [[Resistant|Resistant]] with [[Insanely Tough]], and adds an 100% chance for a level 2 [[Mini-Surge]] from 250-850 range. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 9.0 Update|Version 9.0]].

